#. お主にも何か考えがあるのだろうが…
#. 我には理解できん。
msgctxt "0001 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Maybe you have some idea, but...I don't understand at\n"
"all."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 意味の無い事をおっしゃられても困りますわ。
#. 時間のムダです。
msgctxt "0003 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Your meaningless words tire me. Please stop wasting my\n"
"time."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それが、私の発言にどう関わってくるのかしら？
#. それとも…何も考えていないの？
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What does that have to do with what I said? Or do you\n"
"just not know what you're doing?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、あの時の死体発見アナウンスって、
#. 確か１回しか流れなかったはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But the body discovery announcement was only made\n"
"once, that much I'm sure of...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確か、あの時の死体発見アナウンスって、
#. １回しか流れなかったはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure the body discovery announcement was only made\n"
"once...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、山田クンと石丸クンの死体は、
#. ほとんど同時に発見されたんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But Hifumi and Taka's bodies were discovered at almost\n"
"exactly the same time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
